  "title": "FB Financial Corporation Reports Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Reports Q2 Diluted EPS of $1.13, Adjusted Diluted EPS* of $1.14 Annualized Q2 Loan HFI and Deposit Growth of 11.6% and 7.70%, respectively Repurchased 3.01% of Common Shares Outstanding in Q2 FB Financial Corporation (the “Company”) (NYSE: FBK), parent company of FirstBank, reported net income of $58.6 million, or $1.13 per diluted common share, for the second quarter of 2026, compared to $1.10 in the previous quarter and $0.06 in the second quarter of last year. Adjusted net income* was $58.9 m",
